Vorbis to a 16 kHz mono mu-law WAV file, cut to the sound of one pass
of the original (without the silence before and after it, and, where
the original holds two or three equal passes, to one of them), and
changed in level.  The originals are in the repository
https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base, directory
data/sounds, at commit 1cdfff555f4a21f71ccc978290e2e212e2f8b168:

